# What FastAPI Cloud should not upload from `apps/api`.
#
# `.gitignore` already keeps out virtualenvs, caches and build metadata; this file is only
# for things that are tracked on purpose and have no business in a running deployment.
#
# The suite is the largest thing in this directory and the platform installs the project
# without its `[dev]` extra, so pytest is not there to run it anyway. CI runs the tests
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml) — that is where a red build should come from, not from a box
# with 512 MB of memory.
tests/
